# Workflow: UX Audit

## 1. Scope the review
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/project_profile.yaml`
- Identify the screens or flows under review
- Focus on the paths users see most often

## 2. Review the experience
- Check hierarchy, labels, spacing, and navigation
- Look at loading, empty, success, and error states
- Verify accessibility basics like contrast and focus states

## 3. Check trust and consistency
- Make sure repeated patterns feel the same everywhere
- Ensure AI and premium features are clearly explained
- Flag copy or motion that makes the app feel uncertain or crowded

## 4. Suggest improvements
- Prefer specific, actionable recommendations
- Call out changes that improve clarity without adding clutter

## 5. Report
- Summarize the biggest UX wins and risks
- Separate must-fix issues from polish suggestions
